Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Asteroids" as a single, playable web page. It includes the vector-style graphics, authentic rules, and the feel of the original cabinet.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>1978 Taito Arcade - Asteroids</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #111;
      border: 4px solid #444;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 80, 0, 0.3);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .marquee {
      background: #222;
      border: 2px solid #f80;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #f80;
      color: #f80;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .screen-wrapper {
      background: #000;
      border: 4px solid #333;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 6px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      background: #000;
      width: 600px;
      height: 400px;
      border: 2px solid #f80;
      border-radius: 4px;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background: #1a1a1a;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #f80;
    }
    .control-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .key {
      background: #222;
      border: 2px solid #f80;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #f80;
      text-shadow: 0 0 4px #f80;
      min-width: 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .info {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #aaa;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #333;
      padding-top: 8px;
    }
    .info span {
      color: #f80;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .reset-btn {
      background: #f80;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 6px 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #000;
      margin-left: 10px;
      transition: 0.1s;
    }
    .reset-btn:hover {
      background: #fa0;
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
  <div class="marquee">★ ASTEROIDS ★</div>
  <div class="screen-wrapper">
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="600" height="400"></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <div class="control-group">
      <span class="key">←</span>
      <span class="key">→</span>
      <span class="key">↑</span>
      <span class="key">␣</span>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
      <span
